  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "两层联动：审批拍板",
      "items": [
        "human_approval 节点复用 automation_approvals，拍板走既有任务中心 decide_automation_approval",
        "拍板同事务：节点 waiting→succeeded/failed，run waiting_approval→running 并重投 workflow.run（hops+1 继承）",
        "审批单 request_key=wfnode:{行id}、risk_level=4；到期由 scheduler 定时清扫（无人触碰的过期 pending 不再永挂）",
        "迟到拍板不驱动已取消节点；取消后在途分派返回落 cancelled_after_dispatch 标记，终态不复活"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "调度、重试与幂等键",
      "items": [
        "_begin_node tx A：attempt+1、input_snapshot 落表；缺占位符键直接 failed，绝不填空串",
        "retryable 且 attempt ≤ max_retries 退避回 ready，总尝试 = 1 + max_retries，封顶 20s",
        "崩溃恢复 running→pending（attempt 保留，interrupted:recovered）；worker 层另有可重试类型退避重投（30s×2 封顶 900s）",
        "写类 call 节点分派前落 sha256 幂等键（与 api_actions 同构），跨重试不二次外呼；agent 节点幂等键 wfnode-{行id}:{attempt}",
        "resume/拍板重投 hops+1 继承不清零，入口超 MAX_RUN_HOPS=8 → run 诚实 failed（hops_exceeded）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "取消、恢复与断链（FV-F1）",
      "items": [
        "cancel 幂等：重复取消 200 cancelled=false；终态 409 already_terminal；已执行外呼不回收",
        "queued/running/waiting_approval 均可取消；非终态节点全部 cancelled；pending 审批行不动",
        "resume_run 仅 failed 可恢复（其余 409 not_resumable）：failed/skipped 回 pending、attempt 归零后重投",
        "断链：有 failed → run failed + 下游 skipped(upstream_not_succeeded)；waiting 节点永不 skip",
        "run 级 paused 仅存于 CHECK 值域无写入方；事件 workflow_run_{status}"
      ]
    }
  ]
